msgid "The settings areas 0x93000–0xE8FFF and 0xFC000–0xFEFFF are now in factory state (rewritten and read back where necessary). Beforehand the app checked on the backup from this run that {firmware} has the V15 layout and ends before 0x93000 ({basis}); that is why the tool did not write the boot header and the firmware area 0x0000–0x92FFF. Songs, sounds and settings from these areas – with Melodee also factory sounds and font – are now only in the backup in the recovery folder. Now switch the FM-1 off and on again."
